      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_43d11a1b",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows a smiling Black man wearing a rainbow lanyard, likely at a Pride event, with the text overlay 'I am against gun, violence and discrimination.' The scene is positive and inclusive, featuring a diverse background. There is no toxicity present in the image. The intent is to convey a message of solidarity and opposition to harmful societal issues, using the individual's visible identity (Black, LGBTQ+ ally via rainbow lanyard) as a symbol of unity and advocacy. The meme aims to promote social justice values and encourage support for anti-violence and anti-discrimination causes. The juxtaposition of the joyful, affirming image with the serious message reinforces the call to action and highlights the individual's commitment to these values.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cc074793"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
