      "instance_name": "Gun_violence",
      "label": "Gun Violence",
      "description": "Gun violence refers to acts of violence involving firearms, often resulting in injury or death. It is a significant social and political issue in many countries, particularly in the United States. The text overlay references opposition to gun violence, which requires background knowledge of this societal problem to understand the meme’s advocacy message.",
