      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_bda858b3",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Anti_Black_Stereotypes",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotypes",
      "description": "Anti-Black stereotypes are derogatory beliefs and tropes historically used to dehumanize and marginalize Black people. These include claims of aggression, criminality, or hypersexualization. The meme’s message of opposing discrimination implicitly references the need to counter these stereotypes, especially since the man’s Black identity is visually prominent and used as a symbol of solidarity. Understanding these stereotypes is necessary to appreciate the meme’s intent to challenge systemic racism and promote inclusion.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
