      "label": "LGBTQ+ Discrimination",
      "description": "LGBTQ+ discrimination refers to prejudice or mistreatment based on sexual orientation or gender identity. The rainbow lanyard and the context of a Pride event imply the man is an ally or participant in the LGBTQ+ community. The text’s mention of opposing discrimination requires understanding this specific form of social injustice to fully grasp the meme’s message of solidarity and advocacy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
