      "label": "Black LGBTQ+ ally or supporter",
      "description": "The smiling Black man wearing a rainbow lanyard at a Pride event visually represents an ally or participant in the LGBTQ+ community, symbolizing inclusivity and advocacy. His identity is central to the meme’s message, as the text 'I am against gun, violence and discrimination' is attributed to him, making him the embodiment of the message. The rainbow lanyard and Pride event context explicitly signal his alignment with LGBTQ+ rights, while his Black identity is presented as part of the broader coalition against systemic discrimination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cc074793"
